---
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="bg-[#141311] text-[#FBFBF9] border-t border-[#2C2A26] pt-16 pb-12">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-12 pb-14 border-b border-[#2C2A26]">
      
      <!-- Col 1: Artist & Curatorial Statement -->
      <div class="md:col-span-5 space-y-4">
        <div class="flex flex-col">
          <span class="font-serif-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-[#FBFBF9] font-medium tracking-tight">
            Dhirendra
          </span>
          <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-[#A8A291] mt-1 font-medium">
            Artist & Graphics Designer
          </span>
        </div>
        
        <p class="text-sm text-[#A8A291] leading-relaxed max-w-md pt-2">
          An accomplished visual artist with a foundation in BVA and MVA, over seven years of dedicated studio practice, and recognition through national, state, and government-level honors. Creating art that connects observation, imagination, and expression.
        </p>

        <div class="pt-2 text-xs text-[#8A857D] flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="inline-block w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#B68B35]"></span>
          <span>Studio based in India &bull; Open for commissions &amp; freelance projects</span>
        </div>

        <!-- Quick Direct Contact Actions for Leads -->
        <div class="pt-3 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs">
          <a
            href="tel:+918115604223"
            class="px-3 py-1.5 bg-[#1C1B18] border border-[#33312E] hover:border-[#FAF5E9] rounded-xs text-[#FAF5E9] hover:bg-white hover:text-[#141311] font-mono text-[11px] transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 font-medium"
            title="Call Dhirendra directly"
          >
            <span>📞 Call: +91 8115604223</span>
          </a>
          <a
            href="https://wa.me/918115604223?text=Hello%20Dhirendra,%20I%20am%20interested%20in%20discussing%20an%20art%20commission%20/%20freelance%20project."
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="px-3 py-1.5 bg-[#25D366]/15 border border-[#25D366]/40 text-[#25D366] hover:bg-[#25D366] hover:text-white rounded-xs font-mono text-[11px] transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 font-medium"
            title="Chat on WhatsApp"
          >
            <span>💬 WhatsApp</span>
          </a>
          <a
            href="https://instagram.com/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="px-3 py-1.5 bg-[#1C1B18] border border-[#33312E] hover:border-[#B68B35] rounded-xs text-[#A8A291] hover:text-white text-[11px] transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-1.5"
            title="Follow on Instagram"
          >
            <span>📷 Instagram</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 2: Navigation Hierarchy -->
      <div class="md:col-span-3 space-y-4">
        <h3 class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#FBFBF9] font-semibold">
          Exhibition & Studio
        </h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-sm text-[#A8A291]">
          <li>
            <a href="/gallery" class="hover:text-[#FBFBF9] transition-colors">Digital Gallery Catalogue</a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/services" class="hover:text-[#FBFBF9] transition-colors">Services &amp; Commissions</a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/about" class="hover:text-[#FBFBF9] transition-colors">Artistic Journey & Biography</a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/awards" class="hover:text-[#FBFBF9] transition-colors">Awards, Honors &amp; Press</a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/about#beyond-fine-art" class="hover:text-[#FBFBF9] transition-colors">Beyond Fine Art (Graphic Work)</a>
          </li>
          {/* Temporarily hidden: Track Order & Studio CMS links
          <li>
            <a href="/order-tracking" class="hover:text-[#FBFBF9] transition-colors flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[#B68B35]">
              <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#B68B35]"></span>
              Track Order Status
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/admin/dashboard" class="hover:text-[#FBFBF9] transition-colors flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[#B68B35]">
              <span>Studio CMS Portal</span>
            </a>
          </li>
          */}
          <li>
            <a href="/contact" class="hover:text-[#FBFBF9] transition-colors">Contact</a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 3: Collector Assurance & Certificate -->
      <div class="md:col-span-4 space-y-4">
        <h3 class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#FBFBF9] font-semibold">
          Collector Assurance
        </h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-[#A8A291] leading-relaxed">
          Every original artwork acquired directly from the artist’s catalogue is accompanied by an authenticated physical <strong class="text-[#FBFBF9] font-medium">Certificate of Authenticity</strong> signed by Dhirendra, recording provenance, pigment chemistry, and dimensions.
        </p>
        
        <div class="p-4 rounded-sm bg-[#1C1B18] border border-[#2C2A26] space-y-2">
          <span class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-[#B68B35] font-medium block">
            Direct Artist Dialogue
          </span>
          <p class="text-xs text-[#D3CEBF]">
            For original canvases, graphite drawings, and bespoke civic mural commissions, inquiries are handled directly with the artist.
          </p>
          <a
            href="/gallery"
            class="inline-flex items-center text-xs text-[#FBFBF9] hover:text-[#B68B35] transition-colors pt-1 underline underline-offset-4"
          >
            Explore Creative Works &amp; Gallery &rarr;
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Bottom Colophon -->
    <div class="pt-8 border-t border-[#2C2A26] flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between text-xs text-[#8A857D] gap-4">
      <div class="space-y-1 text-center md:text-left">
        <div>
          &copy; {currentYear} Dhirendra — Artist & Graphics Designer. All rights reserved. Original artwork copyright remains with the artist.
        </div>
        <div class="text-[#A8A291] text-[11px] font-medium">
          Built with 💻 &amp; ☕. By <a href="https://www.rajnikantg.in" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[#FBFBF9] hover:text-[#B68B35] underline underline-offset-2 transition-colors">Rajnikant Gaurav</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center space-x-6 text-[11px] tracking-wider uppercase">
        {/* Temporarily hidden: <a href="/order-tracking" class="hover:text-[#FBFBF9] transition-colors">Track Order</a> */}
        <a href="/contact" class="hover:text-[#FBFBF9] transition-colors">Contact</a>
        {/* Temporarily hidden: <a href="/admin/dashboard" class="hover:text-[#FBFBF9] transition-colors text-[#B68B35]">Studio CMS</a> */}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
